# The share-ready snapshot (HTML scoreboard + the JSON results behind
# it) lives at docs/ and is published by GitHub Pages on every push to
# main. `scripts/visualize.py` writes docs/index.html and copies the
# accompanying JSONs from runs/ into docs/ so the directory is
# self-contained. runs/ stays ignored as the scratch directory for
# heavy artifacts (.pt, .safetensors, intermediate validation reports,
# cascade_host/).

# Generated SM data — checked in for now so the repo is usable without
# running scripts/build_data.py first.  Comment these in to track only
# the build script:
# data/*.npz
# data/*.safetensors
# data/*.json

# Q-Orca artifacts emitted by polygram (large + reproducible)
*.q.orca.md

